    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/663fea9a13f4136b4d48539c2f638a98.avif?t=1738518895\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of Proband 027, a test subject fighting for survival aboard a space station overrun by hostile entities. Your goal? Escape the station by clearing each room, while mastering unique mechanics that turn your gun into more than just a weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Through Enemy-Infested Rooms!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a relentless horde of  threats determined to stop you at every turn. Your goal is simple: eliminate every enemy to unlock the safety doors and advance. But be ready\u2014each room introduces new challenges and enemy types that demand strategy, speed, and quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/82a752fd446635b17f0ccabfd1b2c73e.poster.avif?t=1738518895\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/82a752fd446635b17f0ccabfd1b2c73e.webm?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/82a752fd446635b17f0ccabfd1b2c73e.mp4?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Recoil Into Power!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your gun isn\u2019t just for shooting\u2014it\u2019s your key to mobility. The gun\u2019s powerful recoil can launch you to hard-to-reach platforms or propel you away from danger. Master this unique mechanic to gain the upper hand and navigate the station in ways no normal jump could ever achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/a8cc75f2e8b118252e0b18cb82ed7057.poster.avif?t=1738518895\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/a8cc75f2e8b118252e0b18cb82ed7057.webm?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/a8cc75f2e8b118252e0b18cb82ed7057.mp4?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and Adapt!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing the room unlocks the upgrade machine, where you can modify your weapon. Want faster reloads? Do more damage? Customize your gun to suit your playstyle\u2014but beware, some upgrades comes with trade-offs. Choose wisely to prepare for the increasingly difficult challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/8ff04748f9e0105f2dedda266b991d35.poster.avif?t=1738518895\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/8ff04748f9e0105f2dedda266b991d35.webm?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/8ff04748f9e0105f2dedda266b991d35.mp4?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Survive. Adapt. Escape.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RE:SPACED is an intense experience where every shot counts, every upgrade matters, and every room brings you closer to freedom. Do you have what it takes to make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/663fea9a13f4136b4d48539c2f638a98.avif?t=1738518895\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of Proband 027, a test subject fighting for survival aboard a space station overrun by hostile entities. Your goal? Escape the station by clearing each room, while mastering unique mechanics that turn your gun into more than just a weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Through Enemy-Infested Rooms!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a relentless horde of  threats determined to stop you at every turn. Your goal is simple: eliminate every enemy to unlock the safety doors and advance. But be ready\u2014each room introduces new challenges and enemy types that demand strategy, speed, and quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/82a752fd446635b17f0ccabfd1b2c73e.poster.avif?t=1738518895\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/82a752fd446635b17f0ccabfd1b2c73e.webm?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/82a752fd446635b17f0ccabfd1b2c73e.mp4?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Recoil Into Power!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your gun isn\u2019t just for shooting\u2014it\u2019s your key to mobility. The gun\u2019s powerful recoil can launch you to hard-to-reach platforms or propel you away from danger. Master this unique mechanic to gain the upper hand and navigate the station in ways no normal jump could ever achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/a8cc75f2e8b118252e0b18cb82ed7057.poster.avif?t=1738518895\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/a8cc75f2e8b118252e0b18cb82ed7057.webm?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/a8cc75f2e8b118252e0b18cb82ed7057.mp4?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and Adapt!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing the room unlocks the upgrade machine, where you can modify your weapon. Want faster reloads? Do more damage? Customize your gun to suit your playstyle\u2014but beware, some upgrades comes with trade-offs. Choose wisely to prepare for the increasingly difficult challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/8ff04748f9e0105f2dedda266b991d35.poster.avif?t=1738518895\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/8ff04748f9e0105f2dedda266b991d35.webm?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380820/extras/8ff04748f9e0105f2dedda266b991d35.mp4?t=1738518895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Survive. Adapt. Escape.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RE:SPACED is an intense experience where every shot counts, every upgrade matters, and every room brings you closer to freedom. Do you have what it takes to make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
